moin (1.9.11+py3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * MoinMoin 1.9.11 ported to Python 3 (tested with Python 3.13).
    - Wiki data (pages, users, edit-log, attachments) stay compatible
      with MoinMoin 1.9.x on Python 2, in both directions.
    - Uses the system pygments, passlib and parsedatetime; ships
      werkzeug 1.0.1, flup 1.0.3 and secure_cookie (needed versions).
  * Works without systemd: optional sysvinit script for standalone
    wiki servers; WSGI (Apache mod_wsgi, uWSGI, gunicorn), CGI,
    FastCGI and SCGI are supported, too.

